GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/binary/{hash}
Retrieves a binary file from the Cloudforce One binary storage for analysis.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; hash (path) — hash of the binary

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/banner/{config_id}
Retrieves the latest banner grab results for a Cloudforce One scan configuration, including service banners from open ports.
Required: account_id (path) — Defines the Account ID.; config_id (path) — Defines the Config ID.
